## ⚙️ How Bots Start (LaunchAgent System)

### LaunchAgent Files

Located in: `~/Library/LaunchAgents/`

1. **com.gridbot.tmux.control.plist** - Starts tmux session with bots
   - Executes: `scripts/start_tmux_daemon.sh`
   - Sets PYTHONPATH correctly
   - Starts: Trading Bot, Guardian Bot, Heartbeat Monitor

2. **com.gridbot.webui.plist** - Starts WebUI backend
   - Executes: `start_webui.sh`
   - Needs PYTHONPATH (recently added)
   - Runs on port 5555

### Startup Flow

```
macOS Login
    ↓
LaunchAgent: com.gridbot.tmux.control
    ↓
scripts/start_tmux_daemon.sh
    ↓
export PYTHONPATH=/Users/shailendrasinghrajawat/Projects/WorkingBot
    ↓
Tmux Session Created
    ├── Pane 0: python3 bot/run.py         (Trading Bot)
    ├── Pane 1: python3 bot/guardian/...   (Guardian)
    └── Pane 2: python3 bot/heartbeat/...  (Monitor)
```

