.parent.parent     = /Users/.../WorkingBot/webui
.parent.parent.parent = /Users/.../WorkingBot  ← Should be correct
```

**Attempted Fix:**
```python
# webui/backend/app.py lines 6322-6329 (CURRENT - NOT WORKING)
import sys
from pathlib import Path
project_root = Path(__file__).parent.parent.parent.absolute()
if str(project_root) not in sys.path:
    sys.path.insert(0, str(project_root))

from bot.emergency_kill import emergency_kill_all as centralized_kill
