    "error_rate": 0.02,
    "avg_response_time_ms": 45.2
  }
}
```

**3. Readiness Check**
```
GET /health/ready
```
Returns 200 if ready to accept traffic, 503 if not ready

**4. Liveness Check**
```
GET /health/live
```
Returns 200 if alive, 503 if dead

**Integration (app.py):**
```python
from webui.backend.routes.health import register_health_routes

app = Flask(__name__)
register_health_routes(app)  # Adds all 4 endpoints
```

**Use Cases:**
- Kubernetes readiness/liveness probes
- Load balancer health checks
- Monitoring dashboards
- Debugging production issues

