## 🚨 Critical Safety Systems

### 1. Safety Gatekeeper
All orders must pass through:
- Emergency flag check
- EXECUTE_ORDERS check
- I_UNDERSTAND_LIVE check
- Margin utilization check
- Volatility safety check

### 2. Loss Limits
- Trader: MAX_ACCOUNT_LOSS_INR=₹25,000
- Guardian: GUARDIAN_MAX_ACCOUNT_LOSS_INR=₹20,000
- Guardian acts BEFORE trader stops (₹5,000 buffer)

### 3. Volatility Safety
- MAX_IV: 50% (Implied Volatility limit)
- MAX_RV: 60% (Realized Volatility limit)
- MAX_SPREAD: 15% (IV-RV difference limit)
- Auto-halts trading if ANY condition violated

### 4. Liquidation Protection
- Margin utilization < 40% (GREEN zone)
- Liquidation distance > 60% (SAFE zone)
- Real-time WebSocket monitoring
- Auto-alerts via Telegram

